      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14145:14147"
    },
    {
      "id": "45:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你小心地下到河岸边。落叶和松针被溪水冲向下游，就像是在激流中漂流。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14147:14182"
    },
    {
      "id": "45:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你在溪边跪下，捧起一捧水送到嘴边。溪水凉爽可人，让你精神焕发。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14182:14215"
    },
    {
      "id": "45:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次聆听检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14215:14226"
    },
    {
      "id": "45:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 46。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14226:14241"
    },
    {
      "id": "45:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 51。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:14241:14256"
    }
  ]
}
